    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108143" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποβολ-ῐμαῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
